      "short": "Painted portrait of a bearded man in a textured style with vibrant dotted background.",
      "long": "A painted bust-length portrait of a man with fair skin, reddish-orange beard and mustache, light hair receding at the temples, and intense greenish-blue eyes. He wears a dark patterned jacket over a white shirt and pale blue tie. The entire surface—including face, clothing, and background—is built from dense, distinct brushstrokes and colored dots in blues, greens, oranges, and reds, giving the image a shimmering, tactile quality. The background swirls with color, contrasting with the figure’s forward-facing gaze.",
